#: ../../source/api/data_types.rst:2
msgid "数据类型与消费入口——DataType"
msgstr "Historical Data Types — the DataType Object"

#: ../../source/api/data_types.rst:4
msgid ""
"日常请把 DataType 当作**信息 ID**（字符串）：宽匹配名如 ``close``、``pe``，完整 id 如 ``close_E_d``。"
" 按消费形状选用入口，而不是一律 ``get_history_data``："
msgstr ""
"Please treat DataType as **information ID** (string) in daily life: wide "
"matching name such as ``close``、``pe``，完整 id 如 ``close_E_d``。 "
"按消费形状选用入口，而不是一律 ``get_history_data``:"

#: ../../source/api/data_types.rst:7
msgid "**History**（时间 × 标的）：``get_history_data`` / ``get_kline``"
msgstr "**History** (time × target): ``get_history_data`` / ``get_kline``"

#: ../../source/api/data_types.rst:8
msgid ""
"**Reference**（仅时间）：``get_reference_data``（含 ``cn_gdp``、``close-000300.SH``）"
msgstr ""
"**Reference** (time only): ``get_reference_data``（含 "
"``cn_gdp``、``close-000300.SH``)"

#: ../../source/api/data_types.rst:9
msgid "**Static**（仅标的）：``get_static_data``（如 ``industry``、``list_date``）"
msgstr ""
"**Static** (subject only): ``get_static_data``（如 ``industry``、``list_date``)"

#: ../../source/api/data_types.rst:11
msgid ""
"概念、四条工作路径、双 ID 与精选表见 :doc:`manage_data 章节「用稳定的信息 ID 取数」 <../manage_data/02. "
"datatypes>`； 按业务浏览的完整内置清单见 :doc:`内置 DataType 完整清单 "
"<../references/datatypes/index>`。"
msgstr ""
"Concepts, four work paths, dual IDs and selected tables are available in "
":doc:`manage_data 章节「用稳定的信息 ID 取数」 <../manage_data/02. datatypes>`; a "
"complete list of built-ins browsed by business is available in :doc:`内置 "
"DataType 完整清单 <../references/datatypes/index>`."

#: ../../source/api/data_types.rst:16
msgid "三入口（公开 API）"
msgstr "Three entrances (public API)"

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:1
msgid "根据给定的标的、数据类型与频率，从本地数据源获取历史数据并组装为策略可直接使用的结构。"
msgstr ""
"According to the given target, data type and frequency, historical data is "
"obtained from local data sources and assembled into a structure that can be "
"directly used by the strategy."

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:3
msgid ""
"本入口只接受 ``kind=history``（时间 × 标的）的数据类型。宏观/基准请用 "
"``get_reference_data``，证券属性截面请用 ``get_static_data``；错形状会以英文错误 指向正确入口。可以通过 "
"``htype_names`` 或 ``data_types`` 指定需要的数据种类，并结合 ``shares`` / "
"``symbols``、时间区间与 ``freq`` 控制取数范围；根据 ``as_data_frame`` 与 ``group_by`` "
"的设置，函数返回 HistoryPanel 或按标的/数据类型分组的 DataFrame 字典。 关于数据类型推断、频率转换和 "
"trade_time_only 等高级用法，详见文档「历史数据获取 get_history_data」相关章节。"
msgstr ""
"This entrance only accepts ``kind=history``（时间 × 标的）的数据类型。宏观/基准请用 "
"``get_reference_data``，证券属性截面请用 ``get_static_data``；错形状会以英文错误 指向正确入口。可以通过 "
"``htype_names`` 或 ``data_types`` 指定需要的数据种类，并结合 `⟦ CODE10⟧` / "
"``symbols``、时间区间与 ``freq`` 控制取数范围；根据 ``as_data_frame`` 与 ``group_by`` "
"setting, the function returns HistoryPanel or a dictionary of DataFrames "
"grouped by target/data type. For advanced usage such as data type inference,"
" frequency conversion and trade_time_only, please refer to the relevant "
"chapters of the document \"Get_history_data\" for details."

#: ../../source/api/data_types.rst of qteasy.core.get_history_data
#: qteasy.core.get_reference_data qteasy.core.get_static_data
msgid "参数"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:11
msgid ""
"需要获取的历史数据名称集合；可为逗号分隔字符串（如 ``'open, high, low, close'``） 或列表（如 ``['open', "
"'high', 'low', 'close']``）。若为空，系统会结合 ``freq`` / ``asset_type`` 等参数推断可用的 "
"htypes。"
msgstr ""
"A collection of historical data names to be obtained; available htypes can "
"be inferred for parameters such as ``'open, high, low, close'``） 或列表（如 "
"``['open', 'high', 'low', 'close']``）。若为空，系统会结合 ``freq`` / ``asset_type``."

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:15
msgid ""
"历史数据类型对象列表；语义与 ``htype_names`` 类似，优先使用 ``htype_names`` / ``data_types`` 新接口。"
msgstr ""
"List of historical data type objects; semantics and ``htype_names`` 类似，优先使用 "
"``htype_names`` / ``data_types`` new interface."

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:18
msgid ""
"需要获取的历史数据类型集合，必须是合法的数据类型对象。 "
"如果给出了本参数，htype_names会被忽略，否则根据htype_names参数创建可能的htypes"
msgstr ""
"The historical data type collection to be obtained must be a legal data type"
" object. If this parameter is given, htype_names will be ignored, otherwise "
"possible htypes will be created based on the htype_names parameter."

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:21
msgid "需要获取历史数据的数据源"
msgstr "Data source that needs to obtain historical data"

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:23
msgid ""
"证券代码集合；可为逗号分隔字符串（如 ``'000001.SZ, 000002.SZ'``）或列表 （如 ``['000001.SZ', "
"'000002.SZ']``）。"
msgstr ""
"A collection of securities codes; it can be a comma-separated string (such "
"as ``'000001.SZ, 000002.SZ'``）或列表 （如 ``['000001.SZ', '000002.SZ']``)."

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:26
msgid ""
"证券代码集合；可为逗号分隔字符串（如 ``'000001, 000002'``）或列表 （如 ``['000001', '000002']``）。"
msgstr ""
"A collection of securities codes; it can be a comma-separated string (such "
"as ``'000001, 000002'``）或列表 （如 ``['000001', '000002']``)."

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:29
msgid "YYYYMMDD HH:MM:SS 格式的日期/时间，获取的历史数据的开始日期/时间(如果可用)"
msgstr ""
"Date/time in YYYYMMDD HH:MM:SS format, starting date/time of the acquired "
"historical data (if available)"

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:31
msgid "YYYYMMDD HH:MM:SS 格式的日期/时间，获取的历史数据的结束日期/时间(如果可用)"
msgstr ""
"Date/time in YYYYMMDD HH:MM:SS format, end date/time of the acquired "
"historical data (if available)"

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:33
msgid ""
"获取的历史数据的行数，如果指定了start和end，则忽略此参数，且获取的数据的时间范围为[start, end] "
"如果未指定start和end，则获取数据表中最近的rows条数据，使用row来获取数据时，速度比使用日期慢得多"
msgstr ""
"The number of rows of historical data obtained. If start and end are "
"specified, this parameter is ignored, and the time range of the obtained "
"data is [start, end]. If start and end are not specified, the most recent "
"rows of data in the data table are obtained. When using row to obtain data, "
"the speed is much slower than using date."

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:36
msgid ""
"频率；支持 ``1min``/``5min``/``15min``/``30min`` 等分钟周期，以及 ``H``/``D``/``W``/``M``"
" 等小时/日/周/月周期（如 K 线）。"
msgstr ""
"frequency; support ``1min``/``5min``/``15min``/``30min`⟦CODE7 "
"⟧`H``/``D``/``W``/``M`` Hourly/daily/weekly/monthly cycles (such as K-line)."

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:39
msgid ""
"资产类型过滤；可用逗号分隔字符串（如 ``'E, IDX'``）或列表（如 ``['E', 'IDX']``）。 常见取值包括 "
"``any``、``E``、``IDX``、``FT``、``FD`` 等。"
msgstr ""
"Filter by asset type; comma separated strings can be used (e.g. ``'E, "
"IDX'``）或列表（如 ``['E', 'IDX']``）。 常见取值包括 ``any``、`⟦CODE "
"6⟧`、``IDX``、``FT``、``FD`` Wait."

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:42
msgid ""
"已弃用的复权选项（``none``/``n``、``back``/``b``、``forward``/``fw``/``f``）。 新代码请在 "
"htype 中显式使用复权列名（如 ``close|b``）。"
msgstr ""
"Deprecated reinstatement option (``none``/``n``、``back``/``b`⟦C "
"ODE7⟧`forward``/``fw``/``f``）。 新代码请在 htype 中显式使用复权列名（如 ``close|b``)."

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:45
msgid ""
"``True``（默认）时返回按 ``group_by`` 分组的 ``DataFrame`` 字典； ``False`` 时返回 "
"``HistoryPanel``。"
msgstr ""
"``True``（默认）时返回按 ``group_by`` 分组的 ``DataFrame`` 字典； ``False`` 时返回 "
"``HistoryPanel``."

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:48
msgid ""
"返回 DataFrame 字典时的分组键；常用 ``'shares'``/``'share'``/``'s'`` 或 "
"``'htypes'``/``'htype'``/``'h'``。"
msgstr ""
"The grouping key when returning a DataFrame dictionary; commonly used "
"``'shares'``/``'share'``/``'s'`` 或 ``'htypes'``/``'htype'``/``'h'``."

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:51
msgid ""
"透传给底层取数/频率转换的附加参数（如 ``drop_nan``、``resample_method`` 等）。 详细可选值与语义见文档「历史数据获取 "
"get_history_data」及 ``infer_data_types`` 说明。"
msgstr ""
"Transparently transmit additional parameters to the underlying number "
"acquisition/frequency conversion (such as ``drop_nan``、``resample_method`` "
"等）。 详细可选值与语义见文档「历史数据获取 get_history_data」及 ``infer_data_types`` description."

#: ../../source/api/data_types.rst of qteasy.core.get_history_data
#: qteasy.core.get_reference_data qteasy.core.get_static_data
msgid "返回"
msgstr "return"

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:54
msgid ""
"* *HistoryPanel* -- 当 ``as_data_frame`` 为 False 时，返回包含所有请求数据的 HistoryPanel "
"对象。 * *dict of pandas.DataFrame* -- 当 ``as_data_frame`` 为 True 时，返回按 "
"``group_by`` 分组的 DataFrame 字典。"
msgstr ""
"* *HistoryPanel* -- A dictionary of DataFrames when grouped by "
"``as_data_frame`` 为 False 时，返回包含所有请求数据的 HistoryPanel 对象。 * *dict of "
"pandas.DataFrame* -- 当 ``as_data_frame`` 为 True 时，返回按 ``group_by``."

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:54
msgid ""
"*HistoryPanel* -- 当 ``as_data_frame`` 为 False 时，返回包含所有请求数据的 HistoryPanel 对象。"
msgstr ""
"*HistoryPanel* -- When ``as_data_frame`` is False, returns a HistoryPanel "
"object containing all requested data."

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:55
msgid ""
"*dict of pandas.DataFrame* -- 当 ``as_data_frame`` 为 True 时，返回按 ``group_by`` "
"分组的 DataFrame 字典。"
msgstr ""
"*dict of pandas.DataFrame* -- Dictionary of DataFrame when grouped by "
"``as_data_frame`` 为 True 时，返回按 ``group_by``."

#: of qteasy.core.get_history_data:58 qteasy.core.get_reference_data:32
#: qteasy.core.get_static_data:29 qteasy.datatypes.DataType:9
#: qteasy.datatypes.find_history_data:44
msgid "示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: of qteasy.core.get_reference_data:1
msgid "从本地数据源获取 Reference（仅时间维）数据，返回 ``dict[str, Series]``。"
msgstr ""
"Get Reference (time dimension only) data from local data source and return "
"``dict[str, Series]``."

#: of qteasy.core.get_reference_data:3
msgid ""
"同时接受原生 Reference（如 ``cn_gdp``、``north_money``）与 unsymbolizer （如 "
"``close-000300.SH`` / ``close-000300.SH_IDX_d``）。不需要 ``shares``： "
"宏观数据本身无标的维，基准代码已编码在 unsymbolizer ID 中。 更多使用细节见文档「数据类型 DataType」与 S1.5 消费契约。"
msgstr ""
"Also accept native Reference (such as ``cn_gdp``、``north_money``）与 "
"unsymbolizer （如 ``close-000300.SH`` / ``close-000300.SH_IDX_d``）。不需要 "
"``shares``: The macro data itself has unstandardized dimensions, and the "
"reference code has been encoded in the unsymbolizer ID. For more usage "
"details, see the document \"Data Type DataType\" and S1.5 consumption "
"contract."

#: of qteasy.core.get_reference_data:8
msgid "参考数据名称；逗号分隔字符串或列表。可为宽名、完整 id 或 unsymbolizer 名。"
msgstr ""
"Reference data names; comma-separated string or list. Can be a wide name, "
"full id, or unsymbolizer name."

#: of qteasy.core.get_reference_data:10 qteasy.core.get_static_data:14
msgid "显式 DataType 列表；若给出则忽略 ``names``。"
msgstr "Explicit DataType list; ``names`` is ignored if given."

#: of qteasy.core.get_reference_data:12 qteasy.core.get_static_data:16
msgid "数据源；默认使用全局 ``QT_DATA_SOURCE``。"
msgstr "Data source; defaults to global ``QT_DATA_SOURCE``."

#: of qteasy.core.get_reference_data:14
msgid "开始日期/时间（``YYYYMMDD`` 等可解析格式）。"
msgstr "Start date/time (parseable format such as ``YYYYMMDD``)."

#: of qteasy.core.get_reference_data:16
msgid "结束日期/时间。"
msgstr "End date/time."

#: of qteasy.core.get_reference_data:18
msgid "目标频率；宽名消歧或与内置频率不一致时用于升/降频。"
msgstr ""
"Target frequency; used for up/down frequency when wide name disambiguation "
"or inconsistent with built-in frequency."

#: of qteasy.core.get_reference_data:20
msgid "资产类型过滤；unsymbolizer 宽名歧义时用于消歧（如 ``IDX``）。"
msgstr ""
"Asset type filtering; unsymbolizer is used to disambiguate wide name "
"ambiguities (such as ``IDX``)."

#: of qteasy.core.get_reference_data:22
msgid "最近行数；与 ``start``/``end`` 同时给出时以日期区间为准。"
msgstr ""
"The number of recent rows; when given together with ``start``/``end``, the "
"date range shall prevail."

#: of qteasy.core.get_reference_data:25
msgid "键为完整 ``dtype_id``，值为 index=时间的 Series。"
msgstr ""
"The key is the complete ``dtype_id`` and the value is a Series with "
"index=time."

#: ../../source/api/data_types.rst of qteasy.core.get_reference_data
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr "Return type"

#: ../../source/api/data_types.rst of qteasy.core.get_reference_data
#: qteasy.core.get_static_data
msgid "抛出"
msgstr "Throw"

#: of qteasy.core.get_reference_data:28
msgid "名称为 history/static，或无法解析为合法 Reference。"
msgstr ""
"The name is history/static, or cannot be resolved to a legal Reference."

#: of qteasy.core.get_reference_data:29 qteasy.core.get_static_data:26
msgid "参数类型错误。"
msgstr "Parameter type is wrong."

#: of qteasy.core.get_static_data:1
msgid "从本地数据源获取 Static（仅标的维）截面数据。"
msgstr ""
"Gets Static (subject dimension only) cross-section data from a local data "
"source."

#: of qteasy.core.get_static_data:3
msgid ""
"用于行业、上市日、证券名称等与时间无关的属性。返回以 ``qt_code`` 为索引的 ``Series``（单个名称）或 "
"``DataFrame``（多个名称）；不升频、不编入 HistoryPanel。 更多使用细节见文档「数据类型 DataType」与 S1.5 "
"消费契约。"
msgstr ""
"Used for time-independent attributes such as industry, listing date, "
"security name, etc. Returns as ``qt_code`` 为索引的 ``Series``（单个名称）或 "
"``DataFrame`` (multiple names); no upscaling, no programming into "
"HistoryPanel. For more usage details, see the document \"Data Type "
"DataType\" and S1.5 consumption contract."

#: of qteasy.core.get_static_data:7
msgid "静态数据类型名称；逗号分隔字符串或列表。可为宽名或完整 id （如 ``industry``、``list_date_E_None``）。"
msgstr ""
"Static data type name; comma-separated string or list. Can be a wide name or"
" a full id (e.g. ``industry``、``list_date_E_None``)."

#: of qteasy.core.get_static_data:10
msgid "证券代码池；逗号分隔字符串或列表。与 ``symbols`` 二选一，至少提供一个。"
msgstr ""
"Pool of security symbols; comma-separated string or list. Choose between "
"``symbols`` and provide at least one."

#: of qteasy.core.get_static_data:12
msgid "``shares`` 的别名。"
msgstr "Alias ​​for ``shares``."

#: of qteasy.core.get_static_data:18
msgid "资产类型消歧（如 ``E``）。宽名在多资产下歧义时必须给出 （例如 ``list_date`` 有 E/IDX/FD 等多个版本）。"
msgstr ""
"Asset type disambiguation (e.g. ``E``）。宽名在多资产下歧义时必须给出 （例如 ``list_date`` has "
"multiple versions such as E/IDX/FD etc.)."

#: of qteasy.core.get_static_data:22
msgid ""
"* *pandas.Series* -- 仅请求一个名称时，index 为 ``qt_code``，值为该属性。 * "
"*pandas.DataFrame* -- 请求多个名称时，index 为 ``qt_code``，列为各属性宽名。"
msgstr ""
"* *pandas.Series* -- When only one name is requested, the index is "
"``qt_code``，值为该属性。 * *pandas.DataFrame* -- 请求多个名称时，index 为 ``qt_code``, "
"which is listed as the wide name of each attribute."

#: of qteasy.core.get_static_data:22
msgid "*pandas.Series* -- 仅请求一个名称时，index 为 ``qt_code``，值为该属性。"
msgstr ""
"*pandas.Series* -- When only one name is requested, index is ``qt_code`` and"
" the value is this property."

#: of qteasy.core.get_static_data:23
msgid "*pandas.DataFrame* -- 请求多个名称时，index 为 ``qt_code``，列为各属性宽名。"
msgstr ""
"*pandas.DataFrame* -- When multiple names are requested, the index is "
"``qt_code``, and the columns are the wide names of each attribute."

#: of qteasy.core.get_static_data:25
msgid "名称为 history/reference，缺少股票池，或无法解析为合法 Static。"
msgstr ""
"Name is history/reference, stock pool is missing, or cannot be resolved to a"
" legal Static."

#: ../../source/api/data_types.rst:24
msgid ""
"``get_kline`` 是标准 OHLCV 的语法糖，底层仍走 History 管线；签名见 :doc:`历史数据获取和管理 "
"<history_data>`。"
msgstr ""
"``get_kline`` 是标准 OHLCV 的语法糖，底层仍走 History 管线；签名见 :doc:`Historical data "
"acquisition and management <history_data>`."

#: ../../source/api/data_types.rst:28
msgid "清单与检索"
msgstr "Listing and retrieval"

#: ../../source/api/data_types.rst:30
msgid ""
"``find_history_data`` 返回的结构化结果含 ``kind``、``usable_in``、``recommended_api``； "
"打印路径按行推荐入口，**不要**假定每一行都能 ``get_history_data``。"
msgstr ""
"``find_history_data`` 返回的结构化结果含 ``kind``、``usable_in``、``recommended_api``； "
"打印路径按行推荐入口，**不要**假定每一行都能 ``get_history_data``."

#: of qteasy.datatypes.get_dtype_map:1
msgid "获取所有内置以及用户定义数据类型的清单"
msgstr "Get a list of all built-in and user-defined data types"

#: of qteasy.datatypes.get_dtype_map:3
msgid "是否包含用户定义的数据类型, 如果为True, 则返回所有数据类型，包括内置和用户定义的"
msgstr ""
"Whether to include user-defined data types, if True, returns all data types,"
" including built-in and user-defined"

#: of qteasy.datatypes.get_dtype_map:5
msgid "是否刷新用户定义的数据类型缓存，如果为True，清除缓存并重新获取用户定义的数据类型"
msgstr ""
"Whether to refresh the user-defined data type cache, if True, clear the "
"cache and re-obtain the user-defined data type"

#: of qteasy.datatypes.get_dtype_map:8
msgid ""
"**dtype_map** -- 索引为 ``(dtype, freq, asset_type)``。列包括映射表原有字段 "
"``description`` / ``acquisition_type`` / ``kwargs``，以及派生列 "
"``kind``（``history`` / ``reference`` / ``static``）与 "
"``usable_in``（逗号分隔的入口标记，见 ``infer_dtype_usable_in``）。"
msgstr ""
"**dtype_map** -- index is ``(dtype, freq, asset_type)``。列包括映射表原有字段 "
"``description`` / ``acquisition_type`` / ``kwargs``，以及派生列 ``kind``（`⟦C "
"ODE10⟧` / ``reference`` / ``static``）与 ``usable_in``（逗号分隔的入口标记，见 "
"``infer_dtype_usable_in``)."

#: of qteasy.datatypes.find_history_data:1
msgid ""
"根据输入的字符串，查找或匹配历史数据类型,并且显示该历史数据的详细信息。支持模糊查找、支持通配符、支持通过英文字符或中文 查找匹配的历史数据类型，支持以"
" DataFrame 形式返回更结构化的结果。"
msgstr ""
"Find or match the historical data type based on the input string, and "
"display the detailed information of the historical data. It supports fuzzy "
"search, wildcards, matching historical data types using English characters "
"or Chinese characters, and returns more structured results in the form of "
"DataFrame."

#: of qteasy.datatypes.find_history_data:4
msgid "一个字符串，用于查找或匹配历史数据类型"
msgstr "A string used to find or match historical data types"

#: of qteasy.datatypes.find_history_data:6
msgid ""
"是否模糊匹配数据描述，如果给出的字符串中含有非Ascii字符，会自动转为True - False: 仅匹配数据名称 - True:  同时匹配数据描述"
msgstr ""
"Whether to fuzzy match the data description. If the given string contains "
"non-Ascii characters, it will automatically turn to True - False: only match"
" the data name - True: also match the data description"

#: of qteasy.datatypes.find_history_data:10
msgid ""
"是否模糊匹配数据名称，如果给出的字符串中含有非Ascii字符或通配符*/?，会自动转为True - False: 精确匹配数据名称 - True:  "
"模糊匹配数据名称或数据描述"
msgstr ""
"Whether to fuzzy match the data name. If the given string contains non-Ascii"
" characters or wildcard characters */?, it will automatically turn to True -"
" False: Exactly match the data name - True: Fuzzy match the data name or "
"data description"

#: of qteasy.datatypes.find_history_data:14
msgid "数据频率，如果提供，则只匹配该频率的数据 可以输入单个频率，也可以输入逗号分隔的多个频率"
msgstr ""
"Data frequency, if provided, only data for that frequency will be matched. "
"You can enter a single frequency or multiple frequencies separated by "
"commas."

#: of qteasy.datatypes.find_history_data:17
msgid "证券类型，如果提供，则只匹配该证券类型的数据 可以输入单个证券类型，也可以输入逗号分隔的多个证券类型"
msgstr ""
"Security type, if provided, only data for that security type will be "
"matched. You can enter a single security type or multiple security types "
"separated by commas."

#: of qteasy.datatypes.find_history_data:20
msgid "匹配度阈值，匹配度超过该阈值的项目会被判断为匹配"
msgstr ""
"Matching threshold. Projects whose matching degree exceeds this threshold "
"will be judged as matching."

#: of qteasy.datatypes.find_history_data:22
msgid "数据表名称过滤条件，如果提供，则只匹配来自这些表的数据类型，可以是单个表名或逗号分隔字符串"
msgstr ""
"Data table name filter, if provided, only matches data types from these "
"tables, can be a single table name or a comma separated string"

#: of qteasy.datatypes.find_history_data:24
msgid ""
"- False: 返回历史兼容的 data_id 列表，并打印匹配到的数据类型信息 - True:  返回包含匹配结果详细信息的 "
"DataFrame，不强制依赖打印输出"
msgstr ""
"- False: Returns a historically compatible data_id list, and prints the "
"matched data type information - True: Returns a DataFrame containing "
"detailed information about the matching results, without forcing reliance on"
" print output"

#: of qteasy.datatypes.find_history_data:25
msgid "False: 返回历史兼容的 data_id 列表，并打印匹配到的数据类型信息"
msgstr ""
"False: Return the historically compatible data_id list and print the "
"matching data type information"

#: of qteasy.datatypes.find_history_data:26
msgid "True:  返回包含匹配结果详细信息的 DataFrame，不强制依赖打印输出"
msgstr ""
"True: Returns a DataFrame containing matching result details, without "
"forcing reliance on printout"

#: of qteasy.datatypes.find_history_data:29
msgid ""
"* **data_id** (*list[str]*) -- 当 as_data_frame 为 False 时，匹配到的数据类型的 data_id "
"列表，可以用于 qt.get_history_data() 下载数据 * *pandas.DataFrame* -- 当 as_data_frame 为"
" True 时，返回一个 DataFrame，每一行对应一个匹配到的数据类型，   至少包含下列列：       - name:        "
"数据类型名称       - description: 数据类型中文描述       - freq:        频率       - "
"asset_type:  资产类型       - table_name:  底层数据表名称       - column:      对应的数据字段名"
"       - kind:        消费形状（history / reference / static）       - usable_in:"
"   可用性标记规范串       - recommended_api: 推荐入口（get_history_data / "
"get_reference_data /         get_static_data / none）"
msgstr ""
"* **data_id** (*list[str]*) -- When as_data_frame is False, the data_id list"
" of the matched data type can be used to download data with "
"qt.get_history_data() * *pandas.DataFrame* -- When as_data_frame is True, a "
"DataFrame is returned. Each row corresponds to a matched data type and "
"contains at least the following columns: - name: data type name - "
"description: Chinese description of the data type - freq: frequency - "
"asset_type: asset type - table_name: underlying data table name - column: "
"corresponding data field name - kind: consumption shape (history / reference"
" / static) - usable_in: availability mark specification string - "
"recommended_api: recommended entry (get_history_data / get_reference_data / "
"get_static_data / none)"

#: of qteasy.datatypes.find_history_data:29
msgid ""
"**data_id** (*list[str]*) -- 当 as_data_frame 为 False 时，匹配到的数据类型的 data_id "
"列表，可以用于 qt.get_history_data() 下载数据"
msgstr ""
"**data_id** (*list[str]*) -- When as_data_frame is False, the data_id list "
"of the matched data type can be used to download data with "
"qt.get_history_data()"

#: of qteasy.datatypes.find_history_data:30
msgid ""
"*pandas.DataFrame* -- 当 as_data_frame 为 True 时，返回一个 "
"DataFrame，每一行对应一个匹配到的数据类型， 至少包含下列列："
msgstr ""
"*pandas.DataFrame* -- When as_data_frame is True, a DataFrame is returned. "
"Each row corresponds to a matched data type and contains at least the "
"following columns:"

#: of qteasy.datatypes.find_history_data:32
msgid "name:        数据类型名称"
msgstr "name: data type name"

#: of qteasy.datatypes.find_history_data:33
msgid "description: 数据类型中文描述"
msgstr "description: Chinese description of data type"

#: of qteasy.datatypes.find_history_data:34
msgid "freq:        频率"
msgstr "freq: frequency"

#: of qteasy.datatypes.find_history_data:35
msgid "asset_type:  资产类型"
msgstr "asset_type: asset type"

#: of qteasy.datatypes.find_history_data:36
msgid "table_name:  底层数据表名称"
msgstr "table_name: underlying data table name"

#: of qteasy.datatypes.find_history_data:37
msgid "column:      对应的数据字段名"
msgstr "column: corresponding data field name"

#: of qteasy.datatypes.find_history_data:38
msgid "kind:        消费形状（history / reference / static）"
msgstr "kind: consumption shape (history/reference/static)"

#: of qteasy.datatypes.find_history_data:39
msgid "usable_in:   可用性标记规范串"
msgstr "usable_in: Availability tag specification string"

#: of qteasy.datatypes.find_history_data:40
msgid ""
"recommended_api: 推荐入口（get_history_data / get_reference_data / "
"get_static_data / none）"
msgstr ""
"recommended_api: recommended entry (get_history_data / get_reference_data / "
"get_static_data / none)"

#: of qteasy.datatypes.find_history_data:87
msgid "输入的 s 不是字符串，或者 freq/asset_type/table 不是字符串或列表"
msgstr ""
"The input s is not a string, or freq/asset_type/table is not a string or a "
"list"

#: ../../source/api/data_types.rst:37
msgid "``find_history_data`` 亦在 :doc:`历史数据获取和管理 <history_data>` 中列出。"
msgstr ""
"Listed in ``find_history_data`` 亦在 :doc:`Historical data acquisition and "
"management <history_data>`."

#: ../../source/api/data_types.rst:40
msgid "高级：DataType 类"
msgstr "Advanced: DataType Class"

#: ../../source/api/data_types.rst:42
msgid "专家层与内置策略可直接构造 ``DataType`` 对象；普通取数与策略声明优先使用字符串 ID。"
msgstr ""
"The expert layer and built-in strategy can directly construct the "
"``DataType`` object; ordinary access and strategy declarations "
"preferentially use string IDs."

#: of qteasy.datatypes.DataType:1
msgid "qteasy 中用于描述单一历史数据类型（名称、频率与资产类型）的核心对象。"
msgstr ""
"The core object in qteasy for describing a single historical data type "
"(name, frequency, and asset type)."

#: of qteasy.datatypes.DataType:3
msgid ""
"每个 DataType 由 ``name``、``freq`` 和 ``asset_type`` 三要素唯一确定，可用于 统一声明策略所需的数据、驱动 "
"``get_history_data_from_source()`` 等内部取数流程， "
"并在需要时扩展出自定义数据类型。关于完整的数据类型表与自定义流程，见文档 「DataType 与历史数据类型管理」章节。"
msgstr ""
"Each ``DataType`` is uniquely defined by ``name``, ``freq``, and "
"``asset_type``. Use it to declare strategy data needs, drive internal fetch "
"flows such as ``get_history_data_from_source()``, and extend custom types "
"when needed. See the “DataType and Historical Data Type Management” chapter "
"for the full type table and customization workflow."

#: of qteasy.datatypes.DataType:10
msgid "下面示例展示 DataType 类名（稳定输出）。实际创建 DataType 时，需要提供 name/freq/asset_type："
msgstr ""
"The example below shows the ``DataType`` class name (stable output). When "
"creating a ``DataType``, provide ``name``/``freq``/``asset_type``:"

#: of qteasy.datatypes.DataType.__init__:1
msgid "根据用户输入的名称或完整参数实例化一个DataType对象。"
msgstr ""
"Instantiates a DataType object based on the name or complete parameters "
"entered by the user."

#: of qteasy.datatypes.DataType.__init__:3
msgid ""
"``name`` 可以是宽匹配名（如 ``close``、``close|b``）或完整 id （如 "
"``close_E_d``、``close|b_E_d``）。完整 id 从右侧拆出 freq 与 asset_type。仅输入宽名且未给出 "
"asset_type 时，按目标频率 ``d`` 唯一化； 仍对应多个资产类型则报错并列候选完整 id，不再静默取 MAP 第一项。 调用方显式给出 "
"``asset_type``（含 ``E,IDX`` / ``ANY``）时仍按第一匹配解析。"
msgstr ""
"``name`` 可以是宽匹配名（如 ``close``、``close|b``）或完整 id （如 "
"``close_E_d``、``close|b_E_d`⟦CODE 9⟧`d`` 唯一化； 仍对应多个资产类型则报错并列候选完整 id，不再静默取 "
"MAP 第一项。 调用方显式给出 ``asset_type``（含 ``E,IDX`` / ``ANY``) is still parsed "
"according to the first match."

#: of qteasy.datatypes.DataType.__init__:9
msgid "数据类型的宽匹配名或完整 id"
msgstr "The wide match name or full id of the data type"

#: of qteasy.datatypes.DataType.__init__:11
msgid ""
"数据的频率: d(日), w(周), m(月), q(季), y(年), 1/5/15/30min, h "
"如果给出此参数，必须匹配某一个内置数据类型的频率 如果不给出此参数，将按目标频率 d 唯一化"
msgstr ""
"Frequency of data: d (day), w (week), m (month), q (quarter), y (year), "
"1/5/15/30min, h If this parameter is given, it must match the frequency of a"
" certain built-in data type. If this parameter is not given, it will be "
"unique according to the target frequency d"

#: of qteasy.datatypes.DataType.__init__:15
msgid ""
"数据的资产类型: E(股票), IDX(指数), FD(基金), FT(期货), OPT(期权) 也可以输入混合资产类型，如 'E,IDX' "
"表示股票和指数两种资产类型 也可以输入 'ANY' 表示所有支持的资产类型 如果给出此参数，必须匹配某一个内置数据类型的资产类型 "
"如果不给出此参数且无法唯一化，将报错并列候选完整 id"
msgstr ""
"Asset type of data: E (stock), IDX (index), FD (fund), FT (futures), OPT "
"(option) You can also enter mixed asset types, such as 'E,IDX' to represent "
"two asset types: stocks and indexes. You can also enter 'ANY' to represent "
"all supported asset types. If this parameter is given, it must match the "
"asset type of a built-in data type. If this parameter is not given and "
"cannot be unique, an error will be reported and the candidate complete id "
"will be listed."

#: of qteasy.datatypes.DataType.__init__:22
msgid "参数不在 DATA_TYPE_MAP 中，宽名歧义，或完整 id 与显式 freq/asset_type 冲突。"
msgstr ""
"Parameter not in DATA_TYPE_MAP, wide name ambiguity, or full id conflicts "
"with explicit freq/asset_type."

#: of qteasy.DataType.asset_type:1 qteasy.DataType.asset_type_str:1
msgid "资产类型的字符串表示形式，如'E'或'E,IDX'"
msgstr "String form of asset types, e.g. ``'E'`` or ``'E,IDX'``"

#: of qteasy.DataType.asset_types:1
msgid "所用用户定义的资产类型列表"
msgstr "List of user-defined asset types in use"

#: of qteasy.DataType.data_table_names:1
msgid "获取数据表名称，优先使用用户定义的数据表名称，如果没有用户定义的数据表名称，则使用内置数据表名称"
msgstr ""
"Resolve table name(s), preferring user-defined names; fall back to built-in "
"table names if none are defined."

#: of qteasy.DataType.dtype_id:1
msgid "形如：close_E_d"
msgstr "For example: ``close_E_d``"

#: of qteasy.datatypes.DataType.get_available_time:1
msgid "数据类型在一天之内开始可用的时间，如收盘价在15:00可用，开盘价在9:30可用，高频数据没有可用时间"
msgstr ""
"Time of day when this data type becomes available (e.g., close at 15:00, "
"open at 9:30; intraday types may have no fixed time)."

#: of qteasy.datatypes.DataType.get_available_time:4
msgid "Properties"
msgstr "Properties"

#: of qteasy.datatypes.DataType.get_available_time:5
msgid "asset_type: str"
msgstr "asset_type: str"

#: of qteasy.datatypes.DataType.get_available_time:6
msgid "资产类型，如'E'、'IDX'、'FD'等，因为现在支持多资产类型，所以需要指定资产类型以获取对应的可用时间"
msgstr ""
"Asset type such as ``'E'``, ``'IDX'``, ``'FD'``, etc. With multi-asset "
"support, specify asset type to obtain the corresponding availability time."

#: of qteasy.datatypes.DataType.get_data_from_source:1
msgid "Datatype类从DataSource类获取数据的方法，根据数据类型的获取方式，调用相应的方法获取数据并输出"
msgstr ""
"Method for ``DataType`` to fetch data from ``DataSource`` according to the "
"type's retrieval mode."

#: of qteasy.datatypes.DataType.get_data_from_source:3
msgid "如果symbols为None，则输出为un-symbolised数据，否则输出为symbolised数据"
msgstr ""
"If ``symbols`` is None, returns un-symbolised data; otherwise symbolised "
"data."

#: of qteasy.datatypes.DataType.get_data_from_source:5
msgid "数据类型对象"
msgstr "Data type object"

#: of qteasy.datatypes.DataType.get_data_from_source:7
msgid "股票代码列表，一个逗号分隔的字符串，如'000001.SZ,000002.SZ'"
msgstr "Comma-separated share codes, e.g. ``'000001.SZ,000002.SZ'``"

#: of qteasy.datatypes.DataType.get_data_from_source:9
msgid "开始日期, YYYYMMDD格式"
msgstr "Start date, ``YYYYMMDD`` format"

#: of qteasy.datatypes.DataType.get_data_from_source:11
msgid "结束日期, YYYYMMDD格式"
msgstr "End date, ``YYYYMMDD`` format"

#: of qteasy.DataType.id:1
msgid "忽略数据频率的ID形如：close(E)，用于标记不同资产类型的数据"
msgstr ""
"Frequency-agnostic ID like ``close(E)``, marking data for different asset "
"types"

#: of qteasy.DataType.unsymbolized:1
msgid ""
"return True if this data type is unsymbolized data type (i.e. reference data"
" type)"
msgstr ""
"return True if this data type is unsymbolized data type (i.e. reference data"
" type)"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "DataType 用于以「名称 + 频率 + 资产类型」三元组的方式描述单一历史数据类型，是 数据管线与策略声明历史数据需求时的统一语言。qteasy "
#~ "预置了大量常用 DataType， 也支持通过文档中介绍的接口定义用户自定义数据类型。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "``DataType`` describes a single historical data type as a triplet of name + "
#~ "frequency + asset type—the common language for the data pipeline and for "
#~ "strategies to declare data needs. qteasy ships many built-in ``DataType`` "
#~ "instances and supports user-defined types via the documented interfaces."
